<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Van Lanschot 1996 net profit up 30.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Dutch Van Lanschot 1996 net profit up 30.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     73.1  vs  56.0</p>
<p>    Net interest income		 190.5  vs 162.7</p>
<p>    Fee income			    160.4  vs 125.8</p>
<p>    Gains on financial transactions  8.10  vs   8.9</p>
<p>    Other income			  175.2  vs 138.7</p>
<p>    Operating costs		     229.9  vs 191.4</p>
<p>    Loan cost provision		  30.0  vs  30.0</p>
<p>    Tax					32.6  vs  24.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Dutch bank F. van Lanschot NV said in January it expected 1996 profits to rise at least 20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
